<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan central bank injects $82 mln through swap.</title>
<headline>Taiwan central bank injects $82 mln through swap.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank on Tuesday injected US$82 million, or approximately T$2.26 billion, worth of funds into the banking system through swap trading, banking sources said.</p>
<p>The swap point was between 0.015-0.016, which translates into a Taiwan dollar interest rate of 8.500 percent, the sources said.</p>
<p>Maturation date is set for March 4.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
